Package: dictate-indicator
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Javier Santacruz <javier.santacruz.lc@gmail.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator | gnome-shell-ubuntu-extensions
Enhances: dictate
Homepage: https://github.com/jvrsantacruz/dictate
Description: tray icon showing whether dictation is recording
 Shows the state of dictate in the top bar: a red circle that blinks while
 recording, an amber one while transcribing, with the language and a timer.
 It reads the state file dictate writes, and runs as a user unit that
 `dictate setup` enables.
